# SHA-256 pins for the official Zig release tarballs Hull downloads, in
# `sha256sum -c` format. The single source of truth for both consumers:
#   - scripts/build_zig_bundle.sh (release.yml build-zig: the repacked tree is
#     signed into hull.sha256, so the input must be pinned)
#   - .github/workflows/ci.yml (the linker-zig / embed-zig jobs)
# Values from https://ziglang.org/download/index.json, each tarball also checked
# against its minisign signature (key RWSGOq2NVecA2UPNdBUZykf1CCb147pkmdtYxgb3Ti+JO/wCYvhbAb/U).
# Bumping Zig: add the new version's lines here (and keep the old ones until no
# workflow names that version).
